<!-- The bap6 brief's Word styles, to the form of typst/bap6-*.typ (docs/DOCX.md); fb render builds
     docx/reference.docx from pandoc's default reference with them (tools/fb/src/docxref.rs).
     Mandated form (FRBP 8015(a)(4)-(6)): Times New Roman 14 pt (the typst face), on US Letter with 1 in margins;
     double spacing as the typst body pitch, exact 37.1 pt (742 twips); single spacing (headings, block quotations,
     cover, contents, authorities, signature) as the typst single pitch, exact 18.8 pt (376); first-line indent
     0.5 in, none on the first paragraph after a heading. Headings: level 1 and the front-matter titles bold 19.5 pt
     centered (typst 19.6 pt), level 2 bold 17 pt (typst 16.8 pt), level 3 bold indented 0.5 in, level 4 italic
     indented 1 in. The footers (rIdFtrNone, rIdFtrPage) are added by fb render and the sections written by docx/bap6-brief.lua:
     cover without a number, front matter lower roman from i, the brief arabic from 1. -->
